  "name": "ranged_layer_weight",
  "description": "Pin the effective m_AnimOverlay[0] weight curve during player ranged fire, reload and dry-fire: per-frame slot fields (flags, sequence, cycle, rate, weight, weightMax, blendIn, blendOut, activity) for all four slots off the player entity at CBaseAnimatingOverlay base 0x734 stride 0x30, read on player_item_post_frame whose ECX is the player. Two field layouts are read concurrently (slot layout from +0x0 and the RE report's absolute anchors 0x73c/0x740/0x748) so a one-dword phase error in the struct guess is visible in the capture instead of silently mislabelling weight.",
